This distribution is an unofficial fork maintained by hezhixin15:
https://github.com/hezhixin15/immersive-portals-vulkanmod

It is based on Immersive Portals 6.0.6 for Minecraft 1.21.1 (Fabric) and has
been modified to run on VulkanMod without an OpenGL context. Java files changed
or added by this fork carry a notice at the top of the file; the two modified
mixin JSON files are listed in FORK_CHANGES.md, and the full history is in this
repository's commits.

